  "summary": "<p>The JR-V85P is a 3-axis linear guideway vertical machining center (bare machine) designed for precision CNC integration. Featuring a direct-drive 12000 RPM spindle, X/Y/Z travel of 800×550×550mm, BT40/φ140 short-nose spindle taper, and a robust “A-frame” column structure, it delivers exceptional rigidity and accuracy. Compatible with NSK/FAG spindle bearings, THK/HIWIN ball screws, and Taiwan-made stainless steel guideway covers. Ideal for manufacturers seeking a high-performance VMC platform to pair with their preferred CNC controller.</p>",
