    font-weight: 700 !important;\n    padding: 1.2cqi 1.5cqi !important;\n    text-align: center !important;\n    font-size: 1.2cqi !important;\n    border: none !important;\n  }\n  #qf-v85p-detail thead th.qf-col-hl {\n    background: #E10A1A !important;\n    color: #fff !important;\n  }\n  #qf-v85p-detail tbody tr:nth-child(odd) {\n    background: #f7f8fa !important;\n  }\n  #qf-v85p-detail tbody tr:nth-child(even) {\n    background: #ffffff !important;\n  }\n  #qf-v85p-detail tbody tr:hover {\n    background: #fff0f0 !important;\n  }\n  #qf-v85p-detail tbody td {\n    padding: 1cqi 1.5cqi !important;\n    text-align: center !important;\n    border-bottom: 0.1cqi solid #e0e0e0 !important;\n    font-size: 1.15cqi !important;\n    color: #333 !important;\n    border-left: none !important;\n    border-right: none !important;\n    border-top: none !important;\n  }\n  #qf-v85p-detail tbody td:first-child {\n    text-align: left !important;\n    font-weight: 600 !important;\n    color: #444 !important;\n    background: inherit !important;\n  }\n  #qf-v85p-detail tbody td.qf-col-hl {\n    background: rgba(225,10,26,0.06) !important;\n    color: #E10A1A !important;\n    font-weight: 700 !important;\n  }\n  /* ── 特点亮点卡片 ── */\n  #qf-v85p-detail .qf-grid-3 {\n    display: grid !important;\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr !important;\n    gap: 1.2cqi !important;\n  }\n  #qf-v85p-detail .qf-grid-2 {\n    display: grid !important;\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr !important;\n    gap: 1.2cqi !important;\n  }\n  #qf-v85p-detail .qf-feat-card {\n    background: #ffffff !important;\n    border-radius: 0.8cqi !important;\n    padding: 1.8cqi !important;\n    box-shadow: 0 0.3cqi 1cqi rgba(0,0,0,0.06) !important;\n    display: flex !important;\n    flex-direction: column !important;\n    gap: 0.8cqi !important;\n    border-top: 0.3cqi solid #E10A1A !important;\n  }\n  #qf-v85p-detail .qf-feat-icon {\n    font-size: 2.2cqi !important;\n    display: block !important;\n  }\n  #qf-v85p-detail .qf-feat-card h3 {\n    font-size: 1.5cqi !important;\n    font-weight: 800 !important;\n    color: #111111 !important;\n    line-height: 1.3 !important;\n  }\n  #qf-v85p-detail .qf-feat-card p {\n    font-size: 1.1cqi !important;\n    color: #555555 !important;\n    line-height: 1.5 !important;\n  }\n  /* ── 配置列表区 ── */\n  #qf-v85p-detail .qf-config-grid {\n    display: grid !important;\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr !important;\n    gap: 1.2cqi !important;\n  }\n  #qf-v85p-detail .qf-config-card {\n    background: #ffffff !important;\n    border-radius: 0.8cqi !important;\n    padding: 1.8cqi 2cqi !important;\n    box-shadow: 0 0.3cqi 1cqi rgba(0,0,0,0.06) !important;\n  }\n  #qf-v85p-detail .qf-config-card h3 {\n    font-size: 1.4cqi !important;\n    font-weight: 800 !important;\n    color: #111111 !important;\n    margin-bottom: 1cqi !important;\n    padding-bottom: 0.6cqi !important;\n    border-bottom: 0.15cqi solid #e0e0e0 !important;\n    display: flex !important;\n    align-items: center !important;\n    gap: 0.5cqi !important;\n  }\n  #qf-v85p-detail .qf-config-card h3::before {\n    content: \"\" !important;\n    display: inline-block !important;\n    width: 0.3cqi !important;\n    height: 1.4cqi !important;\n    background: #E10A1A !important;\n    border-radius: 0.1cqi !important;\n    flex-shrink: 0 !important;\n  }\n  #qf-v85p-detail .qf-config-card ul {\n    list-style: none !important;\n    display: flex !important;\n    flex-direction: column !important;\n    gap: 0.5cqi !important;\n  }\n  #qf-v85p-detail .qf-config-card ul li {\n    font-size: 1.1cqi !important;\n    color: #444444 !important;\n    line-height: 1.4 !important;\n    padding-left: 1.2cqi !important;\n    position: relative !important;\n  }\n  #qf-v85p-detail .qf-config-card ul li::before {\n    content: \"●\" !important;\n    color: #E10A1A !important;\n    font-size: 0.6cqi !important;\n    position: absolute !important;\n    left: 0 !important;\n    top: 0.3cqi !important;\n  }\n  /* ── 产品图展示区 ── */\n  #qf-v85p-detail .qf-gallery-grid {\n    display: grid !important;\n    grid-template-columns: 1.4fr 1fr 1fr !important;\n    gap: 1.2cqi !important;\n  }\n  #qf-v85p-detail .qf-gallery-main {\n    grid-row: span 2 !important;\n  }\n  /* ── CTA 底部条 ── */\n  #qf-v85p-detail .qf-cta-strip {\n    background: #E10A1A !important;\n    border-radius: 1cqi !important;\n    display: flex !important;\n    align-items: center !important;\n    justify-content: space-between !important;\n    padding: 2.2cqi 3cqi !important;\n    margin-top: 2cqi !important;\n    gap: 2cqi !important;\n  }\n  #qf-v85p-detail .qf-cta-left h2 {\n    font-size: 2.2cqi !important;\n    font-weight: 900 !important;\n    color: #ffffff !important;\n    line-height: 1.2 !important;\n  }\n  #qf-v85p-detail .qf-cta-left p {\n    font-size: 1.1cqi !important;\n    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.8) !important;\n    margin-top: 0.5cqi !important;\n  }\n  #qf-v85p-detail .qf-btn-white {\n    background: #fff !important;\n    color: #E10A1A !important;\n    padding: 1.2cqi 3cqi !important;\n    font-weight: 800 !important;\n    font-size: 1.3cqi !important;\n    border-radius: 0.3cqi !important;\n    text-decoration: none !important;\n    display: inline-block !important;\n    white-space: nowrap !important;\n    flex-shrink: 0 !important;\n  }\n  /* ── 标准配置说明条 ── */\n  #qf-v85p-detail .qf-std-notice {\n    background: #ffffff !important;\n    border-left: 0.4cqi solid #E10A1A !important;\n    border-radius: 0 0.6cqi 0.6cqi 0 !important;\n    padding: 1.2cqi 1.8cqi !important;\n    font-size: 1.1cqi !important;\n    color: #444 !important;\n    line-height: 1.6 !important;\n    box-shadow: 0 0.2cqi 0.8cqi rgba(0,0,0,0.05) !important;\n  }\n  #qf-v85p-detail .qf-std-notice strong {\n    color: #E10A1A !important;\n    font-weight: 700 !important;\n  }\n  /* ── 型号对比徽章 ── */\n  #qf-v85p-detail .qf-model-badges {\n    display: flex !important;\n    gap: 0.8cqi !important;\n    flex-wrap: wrap !important;\n    margin-bottom: 1.5cqi !important;\n  }\n  #qf-v85p-detail .qf-model-badge {\n    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1) !important;\n    border: 0.1cqi solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2) !important;\n    color: #ccc !important;\n    font-size: 1cqi !important;\n    font-weight: 600 !important;\n    padding: 0.3cqi 0.9cqi !important;\n    border-radius: 0.3cqi !important;\n  }\n  #qf-v85p-detail .qf-model-badge.active {\n    background: #E10A1A !important;\n    border-color: #E10A1A !important;\n    color: #fff !important;\n  }\n</style>\n<p>  <!-- ══ Section 1：Hero 主图区 ══ --><br>\n        CENNETIC · Vertical Machining Center<br>\n        JR-V85P<br>\n        JR-V85P II<br>\n        JR-V85P III</p>\n<h2>JR-V85P<br>Vertical Machining<br>Center (Bare Machine)</h2>\n<p>3-Axis Linear Rail Series · BT40 Spindle · 12,000 RPM Direct Drive<br>Table 550×1000mm · X/Y/Z Travel 800/550/550mm</p>\n<p>          800mm<br>\n          X Travel<br>\n          12,000<br>\n          RPM Spindle<br>\n          BT40<br>\n          Tool Interface<br>\n          7.5kW<br>\n          Motor Power<br>\n          4.5T<br>\n          Machine Weight<br>\n          600kg<br>\n          Table Load<br>\n        <a href=\"https://www.cennetic.com/contact/\">📩 Get a Quote</a><br>\n     <img src=\"https://www.cennetic.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/cennetic-jr-v85p-vertical-machining-center-bt40-spindle.webp\" alt=\"CENNETIC JR-V85P Vertical Machining Center Bare Machine 3-Axis Linear Rail BT40 Spindle\" width=\"800\" height=\"700\" loading=\"eager\" data-srcpath=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/cennetic-jr-v85p-vertical-machining-center-bt40-spindle.webp\"><br>\n  <!-- ══ Section 2：核心特点 ══ --><br>\n  ✦ Core Features &amp; Highlights<br>\n      🔩</p>\n<h3>A-Frame Column Design</h3>\n<p>Exclusive A-frame cast iron column structure provides superior rigidity and vibration damping, ensuring high-precision machining stability under heavy cutting loads.</p>\n<p>      ⚡</p>\n<h3>Direct-Drive Spindle<br>12,000 RPM</h3>\n<p>Direct-coupled spindle (no belt, no gear) delivers 12,000 RPM standard, with optional 8,000 / 10,000 RPM configurations. BT40 / φ140 short-nose interface for fast tool change.</p>\n<p>      📐</p>\n<h3>Full 3-Axis Linear Rail</h3>\n<p>X, Y, Z axes all equipped with premium linear guide rails — smoother motion, longer service life, and higher positioning accuracy compared to box-way designs.</p>\n<p>      🎯</p>\n<h3>Precision Ballscrew<br>4012 Spec</h3>\n<p>X/Y/Z axes use 4012 ballscrews (Silver Star, Hiwin, THK available) with precision lock nuts, ensuring backlash-free transmission and long-term accuracy retention.</p>\n<p>      🛡️</p>\n<h3>Stainless Steel Way Cover</h3>\n<p>X/Y/Z axes fitted with Taiwan-made stainless steel telescopic way covers, protecting linear rails from chips and coolant — extending machine life significantly.</p>\n<p>      🔧</p>\n<h3>Bare Machine<br>Flexible Integration</h3>\n<p>Supplied as a bare machine without motors, electrical cabinets, or sheet metal enclosures — ideal for system integrators to configure with any CNC controller (FANUC, Siemens, Mitsubishi, etc.).</p>\n<h3>📊 Technical Specifications — 3-Model Comparison</h3>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:left !important;width:28% !important\">Parameter</th>\n<th>JR-V85P</th>\n<th>JR-V85P II</th>\n<th>JR-V85P III</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Table Size (mm)</td>\n<td>550 × 1000</td>\n<td>550 × 1000</td>\n<td>550 × 1000</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>X-Axis Travel (mm)</td>\n<td>800</td>\n<td>800</td>\n<td>800</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Y-Axis Travel (mm)</td>\n<td>550</td>\n<td>550</td>\n<td>550</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Z-Axis Travel (mm)</td>\n<td>550</td>\n<td>550</td>\n<td>550</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Spindle Center to Column Rail (mm)</td>\n<td>570</td>\n<td>570</td>\n<td>570</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Spindle Face to Table (mm)</td>\n<td>120 – 670</td>\n<td>115 – 665</td>\n<td>105 – 655</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>T-Slots (Qty · Size × Pitch mm)</td>\n<td>5 – 18 × 100</td>\n<td>5 – 18 × 100</td>\n<td>5 – 18 × 100</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Spindle Taper / Mount</td>\n<td>BT40 / φ140 Short-Nose</td>\n<td>BT40 / φ140 Short-Nose</td>\n<td>BT40 / φ140 Short-Nose</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Spindle Speed (r/min)</td>\n<td>12,000 (Direct Drive)</td>\n<td>12,000 (Direct Drive)</td>\n<td>12,000 (Direct Drive)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>X/Y Ballscrew Spec</td>\n<td>4012</td>\n<td>4012</td>\n<td>4012</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Z Ballscrew Spec</td>\n<td>4012</td>\n<td>4012</td>\n<td>4012</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rapid Feed X/Y/Z (m/min)</td>\n<td>24 / 24 / 18</td>\n<td>24 / 24 / 18</td>\n<td>24 / 24 / 18</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>X-Axis Linear Rail</td>\n<td>35 (opt. 45)</td>\n<td>35</td>\n<td>45</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Y-Axis Linear Rail</td>\n<td>35 (opt. 45)</td>\n<td>45</td>\n<td>45</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Z-Axis Linear Rail</td>\n<td>45</td>\n<td>45</td>\n<td>45</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Motor Coupling Type</td>\n<td>Direct Drive</td>\n<td>Direct Drive</td>\n<td>Direct Drive</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Recommended Spindle Motor (kW)</td>\n<td>7.5</td>\n<td>7.5</td>\n<td>7.5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Servo Motor Torque ≥ (N·m)</td>\n<td>24 / 24 / 18 (w/ brake)</td>\n<td>24 / 24 / 18 (w/ brake)</td>\n<td>24 / 24 / 18 (w/ brake)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Leveling Pad Height (mm)</td>\n<td>65</td>\n<td>65</td>\n<td>65</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Table Load Capacity (kg)</td>\n<td>600</td>\n<td>600</td>\n<td>600</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Machine Net Weight (t)</td>\n<td>≈ 4.5</td>\n<td>≈ 4.5</td>\n<td>≈ 4.5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Column Design</td>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center !important;color:#E10A1A !important;font-weight:700 !important\">“人” A-Frame Column — All Models</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>  <!-- ══ Section 5：标准配置说明 ══ --><br>\n  ⚙️ Standard Configuration<br>\n    <strong>JR-V85P 3-Axis Linear Rail Series VMC (Bare Machine)</strong> — All X, Y, Z axes equipped with linear guide rails. Supplied <strong>without motors, electrical components, electrical cabinet, or sheet metal enclosures</strong>. Assembled, inspected, and painted to international and domestic standards. Ready for CNC controller integration.<br>\n  <!-- ══ Section 6：主要配置清单 ══ --><br>\n  🔧 Main Components &amp; Brands</p>\n<h3>Structural Components</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Resin sand castings — high-density, stress-relieved cast iron</li>\n<li>Ballscrews: Silver Star / Hiwin / THK with precision lock nuts (Yingxi)</li>\n<li>Linear ball / roller guide rails</li>\n<li>Ballscrew dedicated bearings: NSK / FAG</li>\n<li>Couplings: R+W brand</li>\n<li>Leveling pads height: 65mm</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Spindle &amp; Drive System</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Spindle brands: Luoyi / Jianchun / Prossen / Luoli</li>\n<li>Standard: 12,000 RPM direct drive</li>\n<li>Optional: 8,000 RPM / 10,000 RPM</li>\n<li>Spindle counterbalance: Z-axis motor with electromagnetic brake</li>\n<li>Booster cylinder: Beiju / Haocheng / Xiepin</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Protection &amp; Lubrication</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>X/Y/Z stainless steel telescopic way covers — Taiwan Yinxing</li>\n<li>Domestic electric auto-lubrication system: Hegu / Baoteng</li>\n<li>Domestic coolant water system (pump &amp; tank excluded)</li>\n<li>Domestic air cooling pipeline set (compressor &amp; separator excluded)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Finish &amp; Customization</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Paint: Custom color available per RAL / color card</li>\n<li>Standard: CENNETIC brand color scheme</li>\n<li>OEM / ODM available — logo &amp; nameplate customization</li>\n<li>Assembled &amp; inspected per ISO / GB standards</li>\n</ul>\n<p>  <!-- ══ Section 7：应用场景 ══ --><br>\n  🏭 Typical Applications<br>\n      ✈️</p>\n<h3>Aerospace &amp; Defense</h3>\n<p>Precision milling of aluminum alloy structural parts, titanium brackets, and complex contour components requiring tight tolerances.</p>\n<p>      🚗</p>\n<h3>Automotive Parts</h3>\n<p>Engine housings, gearbox cases, brake calipers, and suspension components — high-volume production with consistent accuracy.</p>\n<p>      🔬</p>\n<h3>Mold &amp; Die Making</h3>\n<p>Injection mold cavities, die casting molds, and precision tooling — leveraging the rigid A-frame column for vibration-free deep cavity milling.</p>\n<p>  <!-- ══ Section 8：CTA 底部条 ══ --></p>\n<h2>Ready to Configure Your JR-V85P?</h2>\n<p>Get a customized quote with your preferred CNC controller, spindle speed, and rail specifications. OEM &amp; bulk orders welcome.</p>\n<p>    <a href=\"https://www.cennetic.com/contact/\">📩 Request a Quote →</a><br>\n<!-- END #qf-v85p-detail --></p>",
